<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;width:100%;max-width:600px;">
  <tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:3px solid #0647FF;">
    <span style="color:#06194b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">readysetmail</span>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:20px 16px;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">Hi Dana,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">Google sent the first DMARC report for brightwave-mail.com. It covers mail Google received from the domain on Sun 15 Nov (UTC).</p>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;color:#06194b;"><tr style="background:#f7f8fa;font-weight:600;"><td style="padding:6px 2px;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;">Messages</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;">Passed DMARC</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;">Did not pass</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;">Sending sources</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #d7dce8;"><td style="padding:6px 2px;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;">14</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;">14</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;">0</td><td style="padding:6px 2px;text-align:right;">2</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">Every message passed DMARC: each one was sent by a service that brightwave-mail.com's SPF or DKIM records cover.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">Reports from other mail providers will follow, usually once a day each.</p>
