<p style="margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#525c75;">You get this because you added brightwave-mail.com to Brightwave Studio on Ready Set Mail.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#525c75;"><a href="https://app.example.test/#/w/ws_brightwave/settings" style="color:#525c75;text-decoration:underline;">Email settings</a></p>
  </td></tr>
