<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">For the last two weeks (2–15 Nov, UTC), every message in brightwave-mail.com's reports passed DMARC: 2,480 messages from 3 sources.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#06194b;">100% of 2,480 reported messages passed DMARC in the last 14 days, so your senders look ready. brightwave-mail.com's own DMARC record sets p=none, so mail from brightwave-mail.com that fails DMARC is still delivered.</p>
