<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#525c75;"><a href="https://app.example.test/api/email-preferences/off?t=TOKEN" style="color:#525c75;text-decoration:underline;">Turn off tips about your domains</a> &middot; <a href="https://app.example.test/#/w/ws_brightwave/settings" style="color:#525c75;text-decoration:underline;">Email settings</a></p>
